# Задания Flow для «Цеха сортировки» v5: 16 комнат по одному кадру (стиль end_street_bg3 = finestyle.jpg) + листы спрайтов -> rooms_jobs.json
import json, io, os
P = ("A background painting for the same 2D side-scrolling game, in EXACTLY the art style of the reference image: the same extremely detailed, fine-grained, high-resolution pixel-art PAINTING with tiny pixels and rich dithering; forms are built from color, light and texture only, there are NO black outlines and NO cartoon shapes; realistic proportions, realistic worn materials; the same cinematic lighting: warm orange-amber lamp light glowing against deep cold blue-teal shadows, a wet reflective floor mirroring the lights, rust, stains, peeling paint, exposed brick. "
     "SUBJECT: the interior of ONE room of a grim old Soviet-era industrial plant at night, seen STRAIGHT FROM THE SIDE like a side-scrolling game stage: the flat back wall fills the picture; the ceiling with pipes and cable trays runs along the top edge; the floor is a horizontal band across the bottom 16 percent of the picture, wet and worn, with puddles reflecting the lamps. Hanging industrial lamps cast warm pools of light; a few small teal and red indicator lights; thick cable bundles. Slightly sinister and mysterious (a secret sorting plant), only subtle hints. All objects stand firmly on the floor with soft shadows. %s No people, no animals. No readable text except where specified; no flags, no hammer and sickle, no stars. 16:9. THE ROOM: ")
BOTH = "At the far LEFT and far RIGHT edges of the picture the side walls are seen in sharp perspective, and each side wall has a doorway with a heavy steel door swung open (a passage to the next room)."
LEFTEND = "The far LEFT edge is a solid wall. At the far RIGHT edge the side wall is seen in sharp perspective and has a doorway with a heavy steel door swung open (a passage to the next room)."
RIGHTEND = "The far RIGHT edge is a solid wall. At the far LEFT edge the side wall is seen in sharp perspective and has a doorway with a heavy steel door swung open (a passage to the next room)."
STR = "a STAIRWELL at the end of the building: bare painted brick back wall with two-tone paint and pipes with valves; the LEFT 40 percent of the room is a small lobby: on its wall a big stencilled label %s and a fire hose box; the RIGHT 60 percent is an open stair shaft: only the bare brick wall, completely EMPTY, no stairs and no furniture (a staircase sprite is added later)."
STL = "a STAIRWELL at the end of the building: bare painted brick back wall with two-tone paint and pipes with valves; the RIGHT 40 percent of the room is a small lobby: on its wall a big stencilled label %s and an electrical cabinet; the LEFT 60 percent is an open stair shaft: only the bare brick wall, completely EMPTY, no stairs and no furniture (a staircase sprite is added later)."
R = {
    'r11': (LEFTEND, "a CHECKPOINT LOBBY: a grey steel entrance door on the back wall at the left; a rail of coat hooks with worn jackets; a long wooden waiting bench under a barred window with rain and distant shipyard cranes outside; an old glowing vending machine; a wall clock; a cork noticeboard; black-and-white checkered floor tiles; dark green wainscot paint."),
    'r12': (BOTH, "a RECEPTION for newly arrived workers: on the left a registration counter with a sliding glass hatch and a small glowing green CRT terminal; next to it a steel shelf rack full of numbered cardboard folders; the MIDDLE third of the back wall is an empty stretch of bare wall with nothing in front of it; a barred window with rain outside; on the right a medical gurney on wheels covered with a tarp; a height-measuring ruler painted on the wall; a first-aid box."),
    'r13': (BOTH, "an AIRLOCK: riveted steel-plated walls; exactly in the CENTER of the back wall a big heavy hermetic steel door with a wide dark glass viewing window in it and a dark blank LED board above it; yellow-black hazard stripes on the floor in front of it; at the left two yellow hazard barrels; at the right a tall sealed steel tank with a green glowing sight-glass and hoses; a red rotating warning lamp; a wall keypad; a floor drain."),
    'r14': (RIGHTEND, STR % "ЭТАЖ 1"),
    'r21': (LEFTEND, STL % "ЭТАЖ 2"),
    'r22': (BOTH, "a CHANGING ROOM for workers: on the left a long row of dented numbered metal lockers, one ajar with worn clothes inside; a wooden bench with a forgotten boot and a cap; white and green ceramic tiles on the lower wall; a barred window; at the right a tiled shower corner with a shower head and a closed plastic curtain; a cracked mirror; coat hooks."),
    'r23': (BOTH, "a STORAGE of personal belongings: tall steel shelf racks full of numbered canvas sacks, old suitcases, folded coats and pairs of shoes; a barred window; the MIDDLE third of the back wall is an empty stretch of bare wall with nothing in front of it; a sorting table with a desk lamp and a scale at the right; a bare hanging bulb."),
    'r24': (RIGHTEND, STR % "ЭТАЖ 2"),
    'r31': (LEFTEND, STL % "ЭТАЖ 3"),
    'r32': (BOTH, "a SECURITY MONITORING room: a long desk with a bank of glowing CRT monitors and keyboards, a worn swivel chair; tall server racks with many tiny blinking lights; a barred window; a red alarm lamp; thick cable trays; dark walls lit by the screens; the RIGHT quarter of the back wall is an empty stretch of bare wall."),
    'r33': (BOTH, "a CONTROL ROOM: steel wall panels; exactly in the CENTER of the back wall a big wall-mounted control panel with gauges, switches and one large RED mushroom button glowing; warning stripes; at the right a glass specimen tank with glowing green liquid on a steel pedestal with hoses; a tool cart at the left."),
    'r34': (RIGHTEND, STR % "ЭТАЖ 3"),
    'r41': (LEFTEND, "a ROOF EXIT vestibule: raw concrete walls; the LEFT third of the back wall is an empty stretch of bare wall (a door sprite is added later) with a painted arrow pointing up beside it; in the middle a wall-mounted electrical lock box with a small green and red light and conduits; a barred window with rain; a floor-standing electrical cabinet at the right; a wall lamp."),
    'r42': (BOTH, "a long clean TECHNICAL CORRIDOR: a bare smooth concrete back wall with horizontal cable trays and conduits only near the ceiling; a painted yellow line along the floor; cold fluorescent light; the whole room is EMPTY, no furniture at all."),
    'r43': (BOTH, "a VENTILATION ROOM: a huge round industrial fan built into the back wall in the middle, large sheet-metal air ducts along the ceiling and down the wall, a big boxy ventilation unit with a grille at the left, grilles, a puddle of condensate."),
    'r44': (RIGHTEND, STR % "ЭТАЖ 4"),
}
jobs = [[k, ['finestyle.jpg'], 'KEY' + k.upper() + 'X ' + (P % e) + t] for k, (e, t) in R.items()]
SP = ("Sprite sheet for the same 2D side-scrolling game, painted in EXACTLY the art style of the reference image: extremely detailed, fine-grained pixel-art PAINTING with tiny pixels and dithering, forms built from color, light and texture only, NO black outlines, NO cartoon shapes, realistic worn materials; lit from above by a warm amber lamp, cold blue-teal shadow on the lower parts. Flat pure magenta #FF00FF background; objects well separated by wide magenta gaps; no floor, no cast shadows on the background. Every object is seen straight from the front, standing on an invisible floor, %s. No people. No readable text except small numbers; no flags, no hammer and sickle, no stars. 16:9. OBJECTS: ")
SAME = "all drawn to the SAME scale (a standing adult would be about 300 pixels tall in this image)"
jobs += [
    ['sphide', ['finestyle.jpg'], 'KEYSPHIDEX ' + (SP % SAME) + "TOP ROW, three frames of the SAME tall dented grey double-door metal wardrobe cabinet, identical size and position in each cell: (1) both doors closed; (2) the right door half open, a dark gap; (3) both doors wide open, a dark empty interior with a rail and two hangers. BOTTOM ROW, three frames of the SAME grey steel utility door in a steel frame, identical frame size and position: (1) closed; (2) half open, the leaf hinged on the right swung 45 degrees toward the viewer, a dark gap; (3) fully open, the leaf swung flat to the right of the frame, a dark storage closet with dim shelves inside."],
    ['spfront', ['finestyle.jpg'], 'KEYSPFRONTX ' + (SP % SAME) + "ten separate waist-high objects: a wooden pallet with a stack of three wooden crates; two rusty steel oil barrels; a low concrete barrier block with yellow-black stripes; a steel hand trolley loaded with cardboard boxes; a big wooden cable reel; a rack of four gas cylinders; a pile of numbered canvas sacks; a waist-high section of steel safety railing; a wheeled canvas laundry cart full of clothes; a metal tool chest on wheels."],
    ['spnear', ['finestyle.jpg'], 'KEYSPNEARX ' + (SP % "large") + "five tall foreground elements side by side, each spanning the full height of the image from the top edge to the bottom edge: a pair of thick vertical rusty pipes with a big valve wheel; a steel I-beam column with rivets; a heavy chain hanging from the top with a hook at the bottom; a bundle of thick cables hanging in loops from the top; an industrial lamp on a long cord hanging from the top, the lamp glowing."],
    ['spstair', ['stairref.png', 'finestyle.jpg'], "KEYSPSTAIRX A sprite for the same 2D game: a concrete zigzag STAIRCASE seen exactly from the side, on a flat pure magenta #FF00FF background. Follow the FIRST reference image (the diagram) EXACTLY in shape, size and position: a lower flight of concrete steps rising from the floor on the left up to the right to a small landing, then an upper flight rising back from the landing up to the left, ending at a short upper platform level with the upper floor; solid concrete under the lower flight and the landing. NO handrails and NO balusters at all: only the bare concrete steps, landing and platform, like a classic 16-bit side-view staircase; the visible side faces and the underside of the upper flight are dark. Painted in EXACTLY the art style of the SECOND reference image: extremely detailed fine-grained pixel-art PAINTING with tiny pixels and dithering, forms built from color, light and texture only, NO black outlines, realistic worn chipped concrete, rust streaks, worn yellow safety paint on the step edges, lit from above by a warm amber lamp with cold blue-teal shadows. Nothing else in the image: no walls, no floor, no room, no people, no text. 16:9."],
]
io.open(os.path.join(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)), 'rooms_jobs.json'), 'w', encoding='utf-8').write(json.dumps(jobs, ensure_ascii=False))
print(len(jobs), max(len(j[2]) for j in jobs))
